          "scenarioIds": [
            "s08-source-rectangle",
            "s07-framing-invalid"
          ],
          "evidence": "final-r4/preview-page-3.png, first scene: Source frame and staged crop shows inset 160,90,1600,900, but Fitted result repeats full-source feature placement and size. references.json pair-1-b-active-task@1 part view-5 source-image and rectangle-result use identical 12-column/6-row media placements. Both source/result planes are approximately 468 by 220 pixels despite identifying a 1920 by 1080 source and full 16:9 output target. The retained-output plane in s07 on page 2 also uses the same wide, approximately 468 by 220 presentation for the full 16:9 output.",
          "impact": "The visible preview does not show the selected crop fitted into the output, so the numeric crop and displayed result disagree; image/frame proportions are distorted.",
          "correction": "Render the full source and output frames at their 16:9 proportions within their available regions. Compute the result from the selected source rectangle x=160,y=90,w=1600,h=900: remove excluded margins, scale the remaining schematic features uniformly to the output target, and clip at the frame. Preserve staged Add destination and Apply/Cancel behavior. Check connected s07 retained output proportions.",
          "route": "ui",
          "settledAtUtc": "2026-10-02T21:42:55.126Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "B-UI-R1-02",
          "category": "visual",
          "blocking": true,
          "source": [
