            "interaction-frames.json[id=video-view].regions[id=video-view-video-player]"
          ],
          "scenarioIds": [
            "s04-independent-zoom"
          ],
          "evidence": "final-r4/preview-page-1.png, fourth scene, compared with Fit player at frame750 in final-r4/preview-page-3.png s11: the 200% illustration doubles one boat but keeps the pier at seven of twelve columns by one of six rows, and keeps the sky/water boundary and mast placement unchanged. ui.json part-s04-independent-zoom player-image changes selected object geometry rather than applying one scale/pan transform to the composed image.",
          "impact": "The 200% / pan100,40 label is disconnected from the illustrated spatial inspection: magnification appears to alter individual content instead of inspecting the unchanged composition.",
          "correction": "Use a single uniform 2x spatial transform plus the fixture pan offset for all schematic features, clipped within the unchanged player viewport. Preserve content relationships and selection/time state; Fit must show the same composition at full-frame scale. Document the transform origin if necessary in ui-notes, not in the canvas.",
          "route": "ui",
          "settledAtUtc": "2026-10-02T21:43:54.083Z"
